OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy with
OL,6,Fshowers or longer spells of rain,
OL,7,Fbecoming more settled and drier
OL,8,Fovernight with clearing skies from the
OL,9,Fwest. Winds will ease slightly by the
OL,10,Fmorning inland, remaining strong near
OL,11,Fthe coast.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSaturday:FCool start Saturday, but
OL,14,Fturning wet and windy with rain
OL,15,Fspreading east from mid-morning,
OL,16,Fbecoming heavy at times. Winds will
OL,17,Fstrengthen further during the
OL,18,Fafternoon with coastal gales likely.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
