OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FWindy
OL,6,FSunday with showers and brighter
OL,7,Fintervals. Briefly drier overnight,
OL,8,Fbefore further rain and stronger winds
OL,9,Farrive Monday. Unsettled on Tuesday
OL,10,Fwith rain and showers, blustery winds.
OL,11,FTemperatures around average.
